WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:06.920
zond's config lists the services it checks: metube for now

00:06.920 --> 00:13.500
Add two more services to check: ollama and grafana

00:13.500 --> 00:20.030
Each one gets its own timeout; grafana's is 3 seconds

00:20.030 --> 00:23.560
Save the file and close the editor

00:23.560 --> 00:28.460
Start zond on the same Docker network as the services

00:28.460 --> 00:31.000
Ask zond about metube over plain HTTP

00:31.000 --> 00:34.420
200 OK: metube is up

00:34.420 --> 00:38.370
Now ask about grafana, which is stopped

00:38.370 --> 00:41.470
zond waits out grafana's 3-second timeout

00:41.470 --> 00:45.430
503 "unreachable": a monitor sees that grafana is down

00:45.430 --> 00:50.680
/health asks about every service at once

00:50.680 --> 00:55.850
One service is down, so the whole answer is 503
